{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601310","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1460131001:1":{"text":"長い話し合いの末、ついに具体的な日程やテーマ、ルールが確定した。","source_cn":"经历了漫长的讨论后，你们终于确定了具体的赛程、主题和规则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84799B78C0B6B0F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1460131002:0":{"text":"あなたたちはすぐに、それらの内容を書いた手紙をドリーに渡し、各地に送り届けてもらった。","source_cn":"紧接着，你们将信件交给多莉，分发给了各地等待已久的朋友们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D2C296B495BB08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1460131003:0":{"text":"その手紙を受けて、ユグドラシルでは早速、誰かが闘志を燃やし始めていた……","source_cn":"在薄暮丛林，有人跃跃欲试……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65BC850003B8B543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460131004:1":{"text":"それでは、私は聖石町の予選に参加してくるよ。","source_cn":"那么，我就先出发去尝试下圣石镇那边的挑战了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE28ED35143E293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1460131005:1":{"text":"もう、焦りすぎよ、エルロン！","source_cn":"等等！走那么急干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x790EFCF8DB9D1EBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1460131006:1":{"text":"予選の運営に関わらないなら、あなたも他の参加者と立場は同じよ。","source_cn":"之前都说过了，既然你不来负责主持，那就一视同仁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41278AB6F6763F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1460131007:1":{"text":"各地へ巡礼に行く前に、まずは私たちから参加資格を勝ち取りなさい！","source_cn":"在巡礼各地前，先从我们这里拿到凭证才行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F25EC17E26E7E6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1460131008:0":{"text":"なるほど。では、早速始めよう！","source_cn":"好极了，来试试看吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B0B8F48454B7C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1460131009:1":{"text":"そして聖石町では、誰かが誰かを焚きつけていた……","source_cn":"而在圣石镇，有人煽风点火……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E55747455AA0AB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1460131010:1":{"text":"俺は予選を仕切るつもりも、参加するつもりもないから――","source_cn":"我是不打算组织赛事，也不打算参赛啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA91D28E944D44F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1460131011:1":{"text":"選手選びは、レディーのお二人にお願いしようかな？","source_cn":"所以，就拜托二位女士来筛选这些参赛者如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x582F5BD7C9615D22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1460131012:1":{"text":"マーリン様に会いたければ、まずは私たちを倒してからよ！……みたいな？","source_cn":"要想见到梅林大人，就必须通过你们这关——之类的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB63F6A7752736721","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン様に会いたければ、まずは私たちを倒してからよ！……みたいな？","female":"マーリン様に会いたければ、まずは私たちを倒してからよ！……みたいな？","variant_male_record_index":"168512","variant_female_record_index":"168513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1460131013:1":{"text":"責任重大ですね！私にお任せください、ヴァレンさん！","source_cn":"责任重大！维伦先生，我会尽力而为！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70A553DD271138B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1460131014:1":{"text":"まんまと乗せられてるわね。","source_cn":"别上了这家伙的钩啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0D1342D452A32A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1460131015:1":{"text":"つまらない理由を並べ立てるより、「目障りで騒々しい奴らを消し炭にしてやりたい」の方が、よっぽどしっくりくるわ。","source_cn":"与其说那种无聊的理由，还不如“我想烧掉出现在我眼前会说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x973268C4A9A477DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1460131016:1":{"text":"こういうとき、やっぱりミレイルさんはブレイズウィッチなんだなって思います……","source_cn":"米瑞尔小姐在大部分时间都还是灰烬魔女的做派呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB80661D8B685C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:26:1460131017:1":{"text":"ゴルト・インでは、誰かが得意げに吹聴していた……","source_cn":"在客金旅店里，有人正在吹嘘——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46B1B3B6933207C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1460131018:1":{"text":"だーかーら！俺が船で、あんたらを砂漠に連れてってやるからよ！","source_cn":"所以我说！我到时候就会开着船，带你们去沙漠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D89A3F212FAAA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1460131019:1":{"text":"そういえば、砂漠に港はあるのか……？まあいい、とにかく、俺はこのなんとかって巡礼の試験官だからな！","source_cn":"话说沙漠有没有港口啊……不管这个了！总之这什么巡礼，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F6A5591FC047C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1460131020:1":{"text":"あだっ！ぃってえ！\nルカさん！？なんでぶつんだよ！","source_cn":"哎哟！好疼！\\n卢卡，你打我干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE04CB2F63FBD034D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1460131021:1":{"text":"お前がふざけたことを言うからだろうが。試験官は俺とボスだ！","source_cn":"打的就是你，考官是我和索尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14AF3BDD0AD1F340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1460131022:1":{"text":"たった今、予選の日程を組み終わった。ほら、このリストの通りに、明日までにラスティーアンカーの参加資格を手に入れておけ！","source_cn":"我们刚刚定好了赛程列表，你，照着这个表，明天之前给我打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6DFECD16B307762","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1460131023:1":{"text":"へ？お、俺が？明日までに！？","source_cn":"啊？我？明天之前？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452C5F6AE39DB7EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1460131024:1":{"text":"他に誰がいる？選手たちが乗る船を操縦するって言ったのは、お前だろうが。","source_cn":"那当然，谁让你自己说，要给参赛选手们开船！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44252C65BB184B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1460131025:0":{"text":"資格を手に入れたら、船の整備と物資の補給だ、ほら、さっさと行け！","source_cn":"拿完证明就去整备船只和补给，快，动起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2600E759DA21B33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:40:1460131026:1":{"text":"荘園の跡地では、誰かが不安そうにしていた……","source_cn":"在庄园的旧址，也有人正在忐忑不安……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0B1CF16B38E983D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1460131027:1":{"text":"本日は、予選へ参加していただき誠に……違う。","source_cn":"非常感谢诸位今日愿意来参赛……不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51ECE5C42E338A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1460131028:1":{"text":"皆さま、本日は予選へのご参加、誠に……うぅ、これも違う。","source_cn":"感谢诸位今日到场，参加这场预选赛……唔，还是不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D77534C300B989B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1460131029:0":{"text":"カレリーナ、ずっと、喋ってる。","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，你背了，好久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD3496941DDFBE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1460131030:0":{"text":"そう言えば、会場で失礼なことをしないよう、イゴールに言っておかないと……","source_cn":"唔，我得教教伊戈尔，别在台上太失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EC6A1247331128","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1460131031:0":{"text":"イゴール！こっちに来て、挨拶の仕方を……って、イゴール？どこに行ったの！？","source_cn":"伊戈尔！过来，跟我学问候……伊戈尔，人呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427DA64D81657884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t